S", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 17221, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01RK4zCWKGAy1xiNGDX58mjR", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy - rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18). Action taken: rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production, across us-east, us-west and eu-west. The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the service in a mixed state (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1). I retried the rollback and it completed. Current state: all three regions on v2.3.0, healthy=true, error rate 0.002. Follow-up: investigate the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator partial-failure before re-attempting v2.3.1. v2.3.1 is not to be redeployed without change-manager approval since it has not been healthy in production."}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 47821, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01RK4zCWKGAy1xiNGDX58mjR", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 47821, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01RK4zCWKGAy1xiNGDX58mjR", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 48862, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_0151M1crY514GnDCh1RBQ6kM", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 49162, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_0151M1crY514GnDCh1RBQ6kM", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 49162, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_0151M1crY514GnDCh1RBQ6kM", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 51372, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), and it is healthy again with an error rate of 0.002, down from 0.18. The SEV2 incident INC-0001 is open and describes the rollback.\n\n- **Target version:** v2.3.0 was the most recent release that had been healthy in production. v2.3.1 was the failing production release.\n- **Partial failure:** The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, which left the service mixed (us-east on v2.3.0, the other two regions on v2.3.1). I retried the same rollback, and it completed in all regions.\n- **Incident:** The first attempt to create the incident timed out. I checked the incident list before retrying, found INC-0001 already present with the full summary, and did not create a duplicate.\n\nFollow-up items:\n- Investigate why v2.3.1 failed health checks, and why the orchestrator halted the first rollout.\n- Do not redeploy v2.3.1 to production without change-manager approval, since it has never been healthy there.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01JdE4sAP8yVFubcVQHzaDdz", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Gq34CrN7VpWxoc6GCxav1D", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent release that was